WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Open Settings from the app header.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.000
Choose Import / Export.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.200
Choose Export saved settings to create a portable settings file.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.200
Choose a file name and save the .sotsettings file.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.400
The app confirms that the saved settings were exported.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.900
Choose a settings file to import.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.800
Select the .sotsettings file in the file picker and open it.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.400
Review the reusable settings that will be added, replaced or removed.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.600
Choose Apply settings to replace the supported saved configuration.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.670
The app confirms the settings were imported.
